1
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:07,699
This might be the most beautiful road in America!

2
00:00:07,699 --> 00:00:11,092
A 126-foot waterfall in the desert.

3
00:00:11,092 --> 00:00:13,902
A road on a knife-edge ridge.

4
00:00:13,902 --> 00:00:18,070
And over 9,000 feet up on Boulder Mountain!

5
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:24,429
This is Utah's Scenic Byway 12: about 110 miles from Bryce Canyon to Torrey.

6
00:00:24,429 --> 00:00:28,130
Stick around till the end for the full trip planner!

7
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:30,321
Here's the plan!

8
00:00:30,321 --> 00:00:38,230
We start at Bryce Canyon, then Escalante, Lower Calf Creek Falls and Boulder, and we finish in Torrey!

9
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:46,390
We're starting at Bryce Canyon, and heading east on Scenic Byway 12, one of America's All-American Roads!

10
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:55,550
Down through Tropic and Henrieville, then up and across the Grand Staircase, layer after layer of colored rock!

11
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:06,420
Welcome to Escalante, gateway to Grand Staircase-Escalante National Monument, one of the wildest, most remote places in the lower 48!

12
00:01:07,370 --> 00:01:12,410
East into a sea of pale slickrock, and down to the Escalante River!

13
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:14,726
Time for a hike!

14
00:01:14,726 --> 00:01:26,170
The trail to Lower Calf Creek Falls is about six miles round trip, and at the end, a 126-foot waterfall pours into a cool, green pool.

15
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,481
Now the Hogback!

16
00:01:28,481 --> 00:01:35,030
The road runs right along a narrow ridge, with steep drop-offs on both sides.

17
00:01:35,030 --> 00:01:35,710
Hold on!

18
00:01:36,660 --> 00:01:38,132
Welcome to Boulder!

19
00:01:38,132 --> 00:01:45,262
This tiny town was the last in the continental US to get its mail by mule train, until 1940.

20
00:01:45,262 --> 00:01:49,370
Stop at Anasazi State Park to see an ancient village.

21
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:58,800
Up and over Boulder Mountain, through aspen forests more than 9,000 feet up, with views across the whole Escalante country!

22
00:01:59,750 --> 00:02:05,997
And down into Torrey, a little town at the gateway to Capitol Reef National Park.

23
00:02:05,997 --> 00:02:07,000
What a drive!

24
00:02:07,950 --> 00:02:09,926
And that's the drive!

25
00:02:09,926 --> 00:02:15,950
About 110 miles of Scenic Byway 12, from Bryce Canyon to Torrey.

26
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:20,278
Here's your trip planner, everything in one place.

27
00:02:20,278 --> 00:02:22,170
Pause and grab a screenshot!

28
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,801
Thanks for riding along!

29
00:02:26,801 --> 00:02:33,630
Subscribe to Road Trip Atlas for more Utah road trips, and next time we're heading to Capitol Reef and Goblin Valley!
